(DEFPARAMETER *POSSIBLE-SHORT-FLOAT-EXPONENT-MARKERS*
  (LOOP FOR TYPE IN '(SHORT-FLOAT SINGLE-FLOAT DOUBLE-FLOAT LONG-FLOAT)
